   <text:p text:style-name="P48">U<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>P<text:span text:style-name="T9">. <text:s text:c="4"/></text:span>C<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>O<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>M<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>I<text:span text:style-name="T9">. <text:s text:c="1"/></text:span>N<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>G<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"><draw:frame text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="409" draw:name="투명도를 가진 그림 4" draw:style-name="gr3" draw:text-style-name="P11" svg:width="4.464cm" svg:height="0.28200000000000003cm" svg:x="1.7679999999999998cm" svg:y="0.199cm">
     <draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
      <office:binary-data></office:binary-data>
      <text:p/>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>upcoming</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P50"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="408" draw:name="가로선 16" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P51">(영영사전 뜻)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Upcoming' means about to happen or arrive soon. Upcoming shows near future event. People notice something that has not happened yet but will soon. It is an adjective. For example, 'She is preparing for the upcoming exam' means the one that will take place soon.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="76" draw:name="가로선 15" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>다가오는 / 곧 있을</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">upcoming</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">다가오는 / 곧 있을</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="77" draw:name="가로선 17" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>나는 다가오는 콘서트가 기대된다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">I’m excited about the upcoming concert.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">나는 다가오는 콘서트가 기대된다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">We changed our plan accordingly.</text:p>
