   <text:p text:style-name="P48">A<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>C<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>C<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>O<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>R<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>D<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>I<text:span text:style-name="T9">. <text:s text:c="1"/></text:span>N<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>G<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>L<text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span>Y<text:span text:style-name="T9">. <text:s text:c="4"/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">. </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P49"><draw:frame text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="411" draw:name="투명도를 가진 그림 5" draw:style-name="gr3" draw:text-style-name="P11" svg:width="4.53cm" svg:height="0.28200000000000003cm" svg:x="1.7349999999999999cm" svg:y="0.199cm">
     <draw:image draw:mime-type="image/png">
      <office:binary-data></office:binary-data>
      <text:p/>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>accordingly</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P50"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="410" draw:name="가로선 20" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P51">(영영사전 뜻)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Accordingly' means in a way that is appropriate to the situation, or as a result. Accordingly shows appropriate action or logical consequence. People notice a response that fits the situation. It is an adverb. For example, 'The rules have changed, so please act accordingly' means change your behavior to match the new rules.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="78" draw:name="가로선 19" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>그에 따라 / 따라서</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">accordingly</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">그에 따라 / 따라서</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="79" draw:name="가로선 21" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>우리는 그에 따라 계획을 변경했다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">We changed our plan accordingly.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">우리는 그에 따라 계획을 변경했다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">The supervisor approved the report.</text:p>
