   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="83" draw:name="가로선 28" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Applicant' refers to a person who formally applies for something such as a job or a place at university. Applicant shows person making a formal request. People notice someone seeking something through an official process. It is a noun. For example, 'All applicants must submit their documents by Friday' means everyone formally applying must do so by then.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="82" draw:name="가로선 27" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>지원자 / 신청인</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">applicant</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">지원자 / 신청인</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="84" draw:name="가로선 29" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>모든 지원자는 이력서를 제출해야 한다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">Each applicant must submit a résumé.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">모든 지원자는 이력서를 제출해야 한다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">You are eligible to vote at 18.</text:p>
