   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Eligible' means meeting the necessary requirements to qualify for something. Eligible shows meeting the conditions required. People notice whether someone is allowed or qualified. It is an adjective. For example, 'You are eligible to apply if you have two years of experience' means you meet the requirements to do so.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="86" draw:name="가로선 31" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>자격이 있는</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">eligible</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">자격이 있는</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="88" draw:name="가로선 33" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>18세부터 투표할 수 있습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">You are eligible to vote at 18.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">18세부터 투표할 수 있습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">Please send your resume by email.</text:p>
