   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Resume' means to start again after stopping, or a document listing work experience and skills. Resume shows restarting or employment document. People notice continuing after a break or a job application document. It is a verb or noun. For example, 'She resumed work after her vacation' means started again after stopping.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="90" draw:name="가로선 35" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>다시 시작하다 / 이력서</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">resume</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">다시 시작하다 / 이력서</text:p>
