   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Invoice' refers to an official document listing goods or services provided and the amount owed. Invoice shows official payment request document. People notice a bill showing what must be paid. It is a noun or verb. For example, 'The company sent an invoice for the work completed' means a document requesting payment for the service.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="94" draw:name="가로선 39" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>송장 / 청구서 / 청구서를 발행하다</text:p>
