   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Warranty' refers to a written guarantee that a product will be repaired or replaced if it has problems within a set time. Warranty shows official product guarantee. People notice a promise of repair or replacement. It is a noun. For example, 'The washing machine comes with a two-year warranty' means if it breaks within two years, it will be fixed or replaced at no extra cost.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="98" draw:name="가로선 43" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>품질보증서 / 보장</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">warranty</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">품질보증서 / 보장</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="100" draw:name="가로선 45" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>이 휴대폰은 보증 기간이 남아 있습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">This phone has a warranty.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">이 휴대폰은 보증 기간이 남아 있습니다.</text:p>
