   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Refund' refers to a sum of money returned to a customer when goods or services are unsatisfactory. Refund shows returned money. People notice money given back after a complaint or return. It is a noun or verb. For example, 'She requested a refund because the product was damaged' means she asked for her money back.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="102" draw:name="가로선 47" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>환불 / 환급하다</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">refund</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">환불 / 환급하다</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="104" draw:name="가로선 49" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>고장난 제품에 대한 환불을 원합니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">I want a refund for the broken product.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">고장난 제품에 대한 환불을 원합니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">The street vendor sells snacks.</text:p>
