   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Vendor' refers to a person or company that sells goods or services. Vendor shows seller. People notice someone supplying goods. It is a noun. For example, 'The vendor offered a discount on bulk orders' means the seller reduced the price.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="106" draw:name="가로선 51" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>판매자 / 노점상</text:p>
