   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Shipment' refers to a quantity of goods transported together. Shipment shows transported goods. People notice a batch of items being moved. It is a noun. For example, 'The shipment arrived at the warehouse on Tuesday' means the batch of goods was delivered that day.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="110" draw:name="가로선 55" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>배송 / 선적물</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">shipment</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">배송 / 선적물</text:p>
