   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Itinerary' refers to a detailed plan or schedule of a journey, listing places to visit and times. Itinerary shows travel plan schedule. People notice an organized list of travel activities. It is a noun. For example, 'The travel agent provided a full itinerary for the trip' means a document listing every stop and activity during the journey.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="118" draw:name="가로선 63" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
