   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Reservation' refers to an arrangement to have something kept for your use at a future time, such as a table at a restaurant or a hotel room. Reservation shows advance booking. People notice something set aside for them in advance. It is a noun. For example, 'She made a reservation at the restaurant for seven o'clock' means she arranged in advance to have a table available at that time.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="122" draw:name="가로선 67" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>예약 / 보호구역 / 의구심</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">reservation</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">예약 / 보호구역 / 의구심</text:p>
