     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>호텔 예약을 마쳤습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">I have a reservation at the hotel.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">호텔 예약을 마쳤습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">My luggage is heavy.</text:p>
