    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Brochure' refers to a small booklet or folded sheet containing information about a product, service, or place. Brochure shows promotional informational booklet. People notice a printed document used to share information or advertise. It is a noun. For example, 'She picked up a brochure about the hotel at the tourist office' means a small printed booklet describing the hotel.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="134" draw:name="가로선 79" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>소책자 / 안내 책자</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">brochure</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">소책자 / 안내 책자</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="136" draw:name="가로선 81" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>그녀는 공항에서 여행 안내 책자를 집어 들었습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">She picked up a travel brochure at the airport.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">그녀는 공항에서 여행 안내 책자를 집어 들었습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">The store sells new merchandise every week.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="31" draw:name="가로선 118" draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P11" svg:x1="3.109cm" svg:y1="0.23cm" svg:x2="4.248cm" svg:y2="0.23cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line><text:span text:style-name="T12">Twenty-first</text:span> Sentence<text:span text:style-name="T1">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P12"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13"/>
