      <text:p/>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>subscription</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="143" draw:name="가로선 88" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Subscription' refers to an arrangement where you pay regularly to receive a service or publication. Subscription shows regular payment for continued access. People notice a regular payment for ongoing access. It is a noun. For example, 'She has a monthly subscription to a streaming service' means she pays each month to continue using it.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="142" draw:name="가로선 87" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>구독 / 가입 / 기부금</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">subscription</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">구독 / 가입 / 기부금</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="144" draw:name="가로선 89" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>내 잡지 구독은 다음 달에 만료된다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">My magazine subscription expires next month.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">내 잡지 구독은 다음 달에 만료된다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34">The old theater is closed for renovation.</text:p>
