      <office:binary-data></office:binary-data>
      <text:p/>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>renovation</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="147" draw:name="가로선 92" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P60"><text:span text:style-name="T5">(영영사전 뜻</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52">'Renovation' refers to the process of repairing and improving a building or room. Renovation shows repair and improvement work. People notice construction activity to make a place better. It is a noun. For example, 'The kitchen is closed for renovation' means it is being repaired and improved and is temporarily unavailable.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="146" draw:name="가로선 91" draw:style-name="gr4" draw:text-style-name="P24" svg:x1="0.879cm" svg:y1="0.097cm" svg:x2="7.187cm" svg:y2="0.097cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>개조 / 수리 / 리노베이션</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P54">renovation</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P55">개조 / 수리 / 리노베이션</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P56"><draw:line text:anchor-type="paragraph" draw:z-index="148" draw:name="가로선 93" draw:style-name="gr5" draw:text-style-name="P31" svg:x1="0.847cm" svg:y1="0.237cm" svg:x2="7.155cm" svg:y2="0.237cm">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:line>옛 극장은 보수 공사로 문을 닫았습니다.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57">The old theater is closed for renovation.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58">옛 극장은 보수 공사로 문을 닫았습니다.</text:p>
